WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.990
What is the number one breed to look out for&nbsp;
in a heatwave? It's actually the chow chow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:09.370
they have a very thick coat and relatively short&nbsp;
muzzle which means that their panting isn't as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:14.410
effective at losing heat the same applies for&nbsp;
any dog breed that has a shorter face like a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:19.270
pug or a French bulldog their panty is not as&nbsp;
effective at losing heat you also need to look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:24.070
out for elderly dogs and dogs that are obese&nbsp;
or dogs that have underlying health issues.

